### ========================================
### 认证模块测试
### ========================================

### 登录 - 正确密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 登录 - 错误密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 登录 - 用户不存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "notexist",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 登录 - 空用户名
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 登录 - 空密码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": ""
}

### ========================================
### 注册功能测试
### ========================================

### 注册 - 正常情况
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户已存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户名为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户名长度不足
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tu",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户名以数字开头
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "123user",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 用户名包含特殊字符
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test@user",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 密码为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "password": "",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 密码长度不足
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "ab1",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 密码缺少数字
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser4",
  "password": "abcdef",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 姓名为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser5",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 姓名长度不足
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser6",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "t",
  "email": "test1@example.com"
}

### 注册 - 邮箱为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser7",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": ""
}

### 注册 - 邮箱格式错误
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser8",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### 注册 - 邮箱已存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser9",
  "password": "abc123",
  "name": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}
